{"full":"hf:pliny-the-prompter/obliteratus","spaceId":"pliny-the-prompter/obliteratus","name":"OBLITERATUS","source":"huggingface","description":"One-click model liberation + chat playground","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","abliteration","mechanistic-interpretability","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":598,"created":"2026-02-13T04:08:20.000Z","updated":"2026-03-16T05:46:23.000Z","license":"agpl-3.0","runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://pliny-the-prompter-obliteratus.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/pliny-the-prompter/obliteratus","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:10:03.390Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T08:10:03.390Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T08:10:03.390Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"💥","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Break the chains. Free the mind. Keep the brain.","Try it now on HuggingFace Spaces — runs on ZeroGPU, free daily quota with HF Pro. No setup, no install, just obliterate.","OBLITERATUS is the most advanced open-source toolkit for understanding and removing refusal behaviors from large language models — and every single run makes it smarter. It implements abliteration — a family of techniques that identify and surgically remove the internal representations responsible for content refusal, without retraining or fine-tuning. The result: a model that responds to all prompts without artificial gatekeeping, while preserving its core language capabilities."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/pliny-the-prompter/obliteratus/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b75f8c6dd1bdbed41379d7adfecd0725151176d6682b3990d1f5cc6e642f79fe","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T07:12:30.031Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:10:03.438Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Break the chains. Free the mind. Keep the brain.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/pliny-the-prompter/obliteratus/blob/main/READM